==> Checking unprivileged pre-built release binaries
==> Test 1: install service
    1. Create reviewed strict config: sudo guardctl setup --home /home/USER
    2. Optionally choose an existing key: guardctl ssh suggest
    3. Start: sudo systemctl enable --now guardd
    4. Verify: guardctl status
    5. Desktop notifications (as your user): systemctl --user daemon-reload && systemctl --user enable --now guard-notify
